<title>RUSSIA: Russia Apr industry output rises 0.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russia Apr industry output rises 0.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian industrial production fell four percent in April, but was 0.5 percent up on the same month a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	APR 97    MAR 97    APR 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	-4	  +5	  -4</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	  +0.5	+0.4	+0.4</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
